  "body": "PR #1544 (#1538) adds the MCP tool `fit_stock` (fit the setup's stock to the parts as a box or cylinder with a margin, or per-side allowances; one undoable SetStock; parts only, never fixtures). The camcraft-mcp skill (`.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`) does not list it yet. The skill is a process file, so the row goes in its own process PR (PRs no longer edit PROCESS_VERSION; the merging session bumps it).\n\n**Done means:** the skill's tool table has a `fit_stock` row (parameters, units, undo, the parts-only rule, the refusals), and the process PR is announced on #681 at merge.\n\nRelated: #1538, PR #1544.\n",
